  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. Cook potato in boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a knife, 10-15 mins.\n• Drain and return to saucepan. Add the milk, butter, a pinch of salt and mash until smooth. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62da3c5beae9fe0d48004ff0/step-b0cd20c8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. Drain sweetcorn. Drain and rinse red kidney beans.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook corn and black beans, until charred 4-5 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium-high, and add Jerk seasoning, garlic, tomato paste and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and cook, until fragrant 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62da3c5beae9fe0d48004ff0/step-67df68b0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, stir in coconut milk, a splash of water and cook, until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove from heat. Add baby spinach leaves, stirring until combined and slightly wilted.\n• Meanwhile, preheat grill to high. Transfer filling to medium baking dish. Spread mash evenly over the top.\n• Drizzle generously with olive oil and grill until lightly golden, 5-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62da3c5beae9fe0d48004ff0/step-d5340994.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide Caribbean coconut black bean & corn pie between plates.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62da3c5beae9fe0d48004ff0/step-d49f142f.jpg"
    }
  ]
